    "materials": [
      {
        "id": "C17-D16-S01",
        "sourceText": "[D16新编匿名Development]\n请于2026年10月19日16:30前提交社团器材盘点表。社团器材盘点表须为PDF格式，文件名为社团编号-经办人；门户提示收件成功即结束。",
        "sourceSha256": "2bfbae1b2b062526fad9d64f73764d71b74aa852d33925d22c4209452c70f845",
        "assistedId": "d21-record-02",
        "manualId": "d13-fixture-manual-d23-s01",
        "stimulusSha256": "dbba9885dc868b0e65a6586b561af2485801b081d0ff375ef4f025e7128d0a0c",
        "kind": "RECORDED_MODEL",
        "coverage": [
          "single",
          "exact_time",
          "material_format"
        ],
        "ordinal": 2
      },
      {
        "id": "C17-D16-S02",
        "sourceText": "[D16新编匿名Development]\n请在10月20日前核对迎新志愿者分组，页面显示核对完成；另于10月22日前上传场地使用承诺函，场地使用承诺函须为PNG，平台显示承诺函已收妥。两项分别办理。",
        "sourceSha256": "91618a256c8d2164f54ff274636ef5c790e5d3990d99ee7e2520ddc115fa1bdf",
        "assistedId": "d21-record-03",
        "manualId": "d13-fixture-manual-d23-s02",
        "stimulusSha256": "45b6477598761938c10e44f20b5c16d4997b201ed46794c3fad35899b68c7a7d",
        "kind": "RECORDED_MODEL",
        "coverage": [
          "multi",
          "date_only",
          "material"
        ],
        "ordinal": 3
      },
      {
        "id": "C17-D16-S04",
        "sourceText": "[D16新编匿名Development]\n列入决赛彩排名单的同学须出席辩论决赛彩排，以完成辩论决赛彩排为准。你的队伍未列入决赛彩排名单，本通知不要求你出席。",
        "sourceSha256": "9225590c3aa495e23dea327641798bcfae451f83adc430d2a9b122f206e2a29d",
        "assistedId": "d21-record-07",
        "manualId": "d13-fixture-manual-d23-s04",
        "stimulusSha256": "fc0666b26a2956cc476985e7ca1c19304989045153f03bf3e5f9eebecbec9fb5",
        "kind": "RECORDED_MODEL",
        "coverage": [
          "condition_false",
          "inactive"
        ],
        "ordinal": 7
      },
      {
        "id": "C17-D16-S05",
        "sourceText": "[D16新编匿名Development]\n若安排你担任摄影志愿者，请递交机位安排表，以平台显示安排表已收取为完成。暂定下周二下午办理，摄影岗位安排尚未确定。",
        "sourceSha256": "504b08c986a35f6ca62513accc7e03dfe37e0eaec916629923b971a238854a22",
        "assistedId": "d21-record-10",
        "manualId": "d13-fixture-manual-d23-s05",
        "stimulusSha256": "378c6e6cec6e22ae44c1070f8c887f0adf6fb8371960e7837fe16903e7df916f",
        "kind": "RECORDED_MODEL",
        "coverage": [
          "condition_unknown",
          "vague_time"
        ],
        "ordinal": 10
      },
      {
        "id": "C17-D16-S06",
        "sourceText": "[D16新编匿名Development]\n请先填写校友访谈记录表，记录表必填栏均已填写后，再提交校友访谈记录表；校友访谈记录表格式为CSV，以秘书处确认收妥记录表为完成。",
        "sourceSha256": "56403e58158ef21ca640cd4e3efccf411339e832e9f495dbce908e09c1201b30",
        "assistedId": "d21-record-11",
        "manualId": "d13-fixture-manual-d23-s06",
        "stimulusSha256": "4b3844e396253ccca568a747bc13ba432fbcf940688b7c133417d59b75c62823",
        "kind": "RECORDED_MODEL",
        "coverage": [
          "shared_material",
          "dependency",
          "multi"
        ],
        "ordinal": 11
      },
      {
        "id": "C17-D16-S07",
        "sourceText": "[D16新编匿名Development]\n请在月底前后向宣传组提交摄影作品说明稿，以宣传组确认收妥说明稿为完成；确切日期稍后公布。",
        "sourceSha256": "f0e9fe97d0afebfca848d9ffcc51166ec2f7a7735fe9150d3814607eb116b39d",
        "assistedId": "d21-record-14",
        "manualId": "d13-fixture-manual-d23-s07",
        "stimulusSha256": "7046d52de22285ae09c1a3ca6bef67b12244ff1973bbf104a7456858df2924cd",
        "kind": "RECORDED_MODEL",
        "coverage": [
          "vague_time",
          "single"
        ],
        "ordinal": 14
      },
      {
        "id": "C17-D16-S09",
        "sourceText": "[D16新编匿名Development]\n校车预约平台将在周三晚停机，已保存行程不受影响。无需删除行程，不要提交说明，也不必向值班员发消息。本通知仅说明停机消息。",
        "sourceSha256": "51d5c32e81720af258bee0f9627a8fe2a79bc674fd350ba28c8c82075d3abeaf",
        "assistedId": "d21-record-18",
        "manualId": "d13-fixture-manual-d23-s09",
        "stimulusSha256": "2b4e1b2c861af8d7ce243fe2e5a0eddc26a1dd91fb85c45da042ca0c1d28f6bd",
        "kind": "RECORDED_MODEL",
        "coverage": [
          "no_task",
          "forbidden",
          "background"
        ],
        "ordinal": 18
      },
      {
        "id": "C17-D16-S11",
        "sourceText": "[D16新编匿名Development]\n原定张贴迎新路线图，并登记线下宣讲教室。现调整为：迎新路线图改为提交数字版，平台显示数字路线图提交成功；线下宣讲教室改为预订线上时段，页面保存线上说明会时段。两项分别替代原要求。",
        "sourceSha256": "9c1de9a067b3f7f1728e0ab8989925785ec1b949c501142ff093a7baeb64ac8f",
        "assistedId": "d21-record-22",
        "manualId": "d13-fixture-manual-d23-s11",
        "stimulusSha256": "bd0e18d8817c00fda9d5d530d2507075642dfa99ffdcc22db1ee0087eb15a211",
        "kind": "RECORDED_MODEL",
